{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xinyang-e-36629e7a77258e49c7d9","title":"明帝增宫殿躬掘土悼皇后崩冀州水灾","accounts":[{"id":"xinyang-a-36629e7a77258e49c7d9","label":"正文","text":"明帝增宫殿躬掘土悼皇后崩冀州水灾","evidence":["xinyang-q-801a4c9b6ec04b2aff74"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"兴作","evidence":["xinyang-q-801a4c9b6ec04b2aff74"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0009","role":"去世","evidence":["xinyang-q-801a4c9b6ec04b2aff74"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["xinyang-q-801a4c9b6ec04b2aff74"]},"ordering_evidence":"xinyang-q-801a4c9b6ec04b2aff74","order":5110}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0009","name":"毛皇后","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xinyang-q-801a4c9b6ec04b2aff74","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-66365b15e10a5fc0fa23","layer":"original","quote":"帝愈增崇宫殿，雕饰观阁；凿太行之石英〖1〗，采穀城之文石〖2〗；起景阳山于芳林之园〖3〗，建昭阳殿于太极之北〖4〗；铸作黄龙、凤凰、奇伟之兽，饰金墉、陵云台、陵霄阙〖5〗。百役繁兴，作者万数；公卿以下至于学生，莫不展力；帝乃躬自掘土以率之。而辽东不朝〖6〗，悼皇后崩〖7〗；天作淫雨，冀州水出，漂没民物。","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":443,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":152,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
